This project is a C++ port of that script's scan search. Files derived from it
carry a notice at the top saying so.

src/engine_direct.cpp follows the Huffman encoders of libjpeg-turbo 3.2.0
(jcphuff.c, jchuff.c, jcmarker.c, jctrans.c). This software is based in part on
the work of the Independent JPEG Group. The libjpeg-turbo and IJG license texts
are in licenses/libjpeg-turbo.

Binaries built standalone also include libjpeg-turbo itself.
